The calendar, the results and the standings come from the public API behind
the official website motogp.com (https://api.motogp.pulselive.com), read
without a key, a few dozen requests a day. The widgets and the calendar
events name motogp.com as their source. The files under test/fixtures are
reduced copies of answers of this API, kept only to test their reading.

